      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The number of patients likely to require management of cancer pain is increasing. However, although modern analgesia can help most patients achieve complete pain relief, some studies report widespread under-treatment of all types of pain. This paper describes approaches that health professionals can employ to ensure optimum pain management."},
